{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o131c","title":"曹军渡渭立营破夜袭","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o131c-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操设疑兵，以舟载兵入渭，搭浮桥分兵渭南；伏兵击退夜袭。马超等求割河西议和，曹操不许。","evidence":["wudi-e-o131c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"设营拒和","evidence":["wudi-e-o131c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"求和","evidence":["wudi-e-o131c-q"]}],"place":{"text":"渭口、渭南","evidence":["wudi-e-o131c-q"]},"time":{"label":"西征时","year":211,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o131c-q","wudi-q-o128","wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b"],"chronology":"wudi-y211","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o128","basis":"西征时","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,741,"O131c"],"order":313}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0282","name":"马超","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o131c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-cb037f7d9161bae279b3","layer":"original","quote":"循河为甬道而南〖7〗。贼退，拒渭口〖8〗。公乃多设疑兵，潜以舟载兵入渭，为浮桥；夜，分兵结营于渭南。贼夜攻营，伏兵击破之。超等屯渭南，遣信求割河以西请和〖9〗；公不许。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":96,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-889c5acff5776ef2f54b","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o128","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-37e542ccc37d1632e170","layer":"original","quote":"十六年春正月〖1〗，﹝一﹞天子命公世子丕为五官中郎将〖2〗，置官属〖3〗；为丞相副。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","s